325
37:33.872 --> 37:35.181
You’re unbelievable.

326
37:37.009 --> 37:40.807
Well, nobody’s forcing you.

327
37:40.808 --> 37:42.394
Let’s just drop it.

328
37:42.395 --> 37:44.107
Let’s just go.

329
37:45.123 --> 37:47.188
I’m only looking out for you.

330
37:47.188 --> 37:49.528
What if someone saw you two?

331
37:50.815 --> 37:53.407
Oh, really? That’s what you’re worried about?

332
37:53.407 --> 37:55.900
No one saw us! Let’s just move on to the next one.

333
37:56.314 --> 37:57.706
Gross.

334
37:57.707 --> 37:59.509
Wow, still not over it?

335
38:00.111 --> 38:01.397
