382
40:48.495 --> 40:50.802
Eight, bro. Traffic was crazy, so I left early.

383
40:50.803 --> 40:51.886
Damn, that’s early, bro.

384
40:51.896 --> 40:53.605
So you came in pretty early.

385
40:53.611 --> 40:55.799
- I didn’t wanna get stuck in traffic. - Good call. Traffic’s pretty bad—

386
40:55.800 --> 40:56.800
Hi, Kobe.

387
40:58.099 --> 40:59.099
Jules?

388
40:59.604 --> 41:01.481
So this is where I’ll find you.

389
41:02.700 --> 41:03.900
