417
42:32.016 --> 42:33.851
- Let’s go? - Let’s go.

418
42:40.016 --> 42:41.506
Wait. Hold on a minute.

419
42:41.506 --> 42:43.894
- Someone might— - Relax, my bosses aren’t around.

420
42:43.895 --> 42:46.397
