421
42:46.397 --> 42:47.608
I fell for you.

422
42:49.713 --> 42:50.713
Wait—

423
42:51.318 --> 42:53.320
You’re coming on a little strong.

424
42:54.516 --> 42:55.740
Fine.

425
42:55.741 --> 42:56.954
This is what you wanted, right?

426
46:05.123 --> 46:06.123
Jules?

427
46:08.525 --> 46:10.393
- You know me? - I do.

428
46:10.393 --> 46:12.597
Aren’t you King’s friend?

429
46:12.604 --> 46:15.101
I see you on his stories all the time.

430
46:15.101 --> 46:16.101
Friend?

431
46:17.099 --> 46:18.099
Me?

432
46:19.415 --> 46:20.683
Who the heck are you?

433
46:20.684 --> 46:21.684
I’m Lani.

434
46:22.112 --> 46:23.156
Lani?

435
46:23.156 --> 46:24.615
King’s girlfriend.

436
46:25.199 --> 46:27.618
How can you be his girlfriend when I’m King’s girlfriend?

437
46:28.317 --> 46:29.317
What?

438
46:30.524 --> 46:31.691
