443
47:03.305 --> 47:04.305
Oh...

444
47:05.617 --> 47:07.202
so you were together first.

445
47:09.118 --> 47:11.502
He was just using me. Fuck that guy.

446
47:11.502 --> 47:12.663
What an asshole.

447
47:14.444 --> 47:17.989
You mean he played us both!

448
47:18.794 --> 47:20.838
That guy has some nerve.

449
47:23.799 --> 47:24.925
You know,

450
47:25.885 --> 47:27.970
