466
48:14.813 --> 48:17.190
Fuck him! I hope he rots in hell.

467
48:20.387 --> 48:21.430
So infuriating.

468
48:31.422 --> 48:33.007
We’re here!

469
48:33.830 --> 48:35.582
Uh, you can go ahead.

470
48:36.110 --> 48:38.320
