473
48:45.622 --> 48:49.000
We’re here to get even, remember?

474
48:49.717 --> 48:50.885
Of course!

475
48:51.310 --> 48:52.603
I’m not stupid...

476
48:53.518 --> 48:54.727
Don’t worry.

477
48:55.107 --> 48:57.276
I’m here to finish what we started.

478
48:57.995 --> 48:59.664
I won’t let you guys down.

479
49:03.807 --> 49:07.519
If you change your mind,

480
49:08.011 --> 49:10.763
Jules and I will shave you bald.

481
49:55.316 --> 49:58.069
Yes, I’ve already paid for the engagement party in full.

482
49:58.787 --> 50:00.121
And the catering, too.

483
50:00.519 --> 50:03.000
I’ve already spent so much on this, so…

484
50:03.001 --> 50:05.189
