485
50:05.808 --> 50:07.602
Yes, thank you so much.

486
50:09.020 --> 50:10.104
Thank you.

487
50:10.104 --> 50:11.193
Bye.

488
50:17.998 --> 50:19.290
- Hi, Hon! - Hon!

489
50:22.797 --> 50:24.209
I’ve been waiting to see you.

490
50:24.705 --> 50:26.165
I’ve missed you so much.

491
50:27.497 --> 50:31.250
Sorry, traffic was bad. Have you been waiting long?

492
50:31.702 --> 50:32.703
Not really.

493
50:33.089 --> 50:36.389
Are you ready for your engagement party tomorrow?

494
50:36.896 --> 50:38.481
There’s no turning back now.

495
50:38.913 --> 50:40.289
You’re all mine now.

496
50:41.891 --> 50:43.434
I’ve been yours for a long time, hon.

497
50:48.316 --> 50:49.316
I’m excited.

498
56:58.814 --> 57:01.811
You know, you’re the only one who has ever tamed me.

499
57:04.999 --> 57:06.290
Oh yeah?

500
57:06.811 --> 57:08.188
Were you a bad boy back then?

501
57:10.010 --> 57:12.429
I used to be pretty reckless.

502
57:13.824 --> 57:16.602
But one day,

503
57:16.602 --> 57:18.287
I realized I wanted to marry you.

504
57:19.413 --> 57:21.605
I want to start a family with you.

505
57:22.426 --> 57:24.178
You’re the woman I want to do that with.

506
57:26.010 --> 57:27.207
