507
57:27.208 --> 57:30.800
You had other girls besides me, didn’t you?

508
57:34.406 --> 57:39.036
Finally, I get to meet your family, and you get to meet mine.

509
57:42.227 --> 57:43.520
I can’t wait to meet to them.

510
57:48.708 --> 57:51.809
Let’s have dinner. There’s someone I want you to meet.

511
57:51.809 --> 57:52.841
Okay.

512
58:38.818 --> 58:40.195
Thank you.

513
58:43.399 --> 58:44.400
Thank you.

514
58:45.514 --> 58:46.699
Hon,

515
58:46.699 --> 58:48.591
Mom and Dad won’t be here until tomorrow.

516
58:49.198 --> 58:50.622
Okay, no problem.

517
58:50.622 --> 58:52.892
My parents aren’t arriving until tomorrow either.

518
58:55.496 --> 58:57.831
Why don’t you meet my siblings first?

519
58:58.718 --> 59:01.906
Hon, my friends are here, too. They're on their way.

520
59:01.906 --> 59:02.906
You should meet them.

521
59:06.797 --> 59:08.132
Oh, there they are!

522
59:17.202 --> 59:18.322
Hon… those are your friends?

523
59:18.811 --> 59:19.811
Yep!

524
59:21.513 --> 59:22.513
Hi, King.

525
59:23.016 --> 59:25.099
Nice to finally meet you.

526
59:25.099 --> 59:27.821
Mia talks about you all the time.

527
59:29.501 --> 59:30.501
Really?

528
59:38.787 --> 59:39.912
Hon,

529
59:39.920 --> 59:41.463
it’s kinda hot in here.

530
59:42.428 --> 59:44.211
Let’s move to another table.

531
59:44.211 --> 59:45.999
It feels fine to me.

532
59:45.999 --> 59:48.928
I’m actually kinda cold. The AC’s too strong.

533
59:48.929 --> 59:50.295
Right, girls?

534
59:50.296 --> 59:51.422
Exactly.

535
59:51.422 --> 59:53.602
It’s actually nice and cool in here.

536
59:54.617 --> 59:59.747
Mia, your future husband seems kinda shy.

537
01:00:00.313 --> 01:00:02.023
