538
01:00:04.017 --> 01:00:05.185
Perfect timing.

539
01:00:05.186 --> 01:00:06.604
My siblings are here, too.

540
01:00:10.937 --> 01:00:11.939
- Ma’am Lani? - Jules?

541
01:00:11.942 --> 01:00:12.942
Ma’am Mia?

542
01:00:14.220 --> 01:00:16.431
Wait, you guys know each other?

543
01:00:30.295 --> 01:00:31.994
They’re my ex-girlfriends.

544
01:00:31.995 --> 01:00:33.214
What?

545
01:00:33.214 --> 01:00:34.214
All of them?

546
01:00:35.520 --> 01:00:37.217
Lani and Jules.

547
01:00:37.218 --> 01:00:38.816
Bro! Even Jules?

548
01:00:40.316 --> 01:00:41.691
Now I get it.

549
01:00:41.692 --> 01:00:43.900
You were just using me to get back at my brother.

550
01:00:45.905 --> 01:00:47.782
You’re awfully quiet, Kean.

551
01:00:50.510 --> 01:00:53.012
What, we’re strangers now? After seeing each other earlier?

552
01:00:55.206 --> 01:00:56.698
You guys met up earlier?

553
01:00:56.699 --> 01:00:58.169
Bro, I didn’t know…

554
01:00:59.215 --> 01:01:00.488
What happened, Kean?

555
01:01:00.489 --> 01:01:01.489
Answer me!

556
01:01:02.913 --> 01:01:04.039
We had sex.

557
01:01:05.221 --> 01:01:06.904
- What? - You son of a bitch, Kean!

558
01:01:06.905 --> 01:01:08.207
Bro, I didn’t know!

559
01:01:08.207 --> 01:01:09.415
King! That’s enough!

560
01:01:09.416 --> 01:01:12.223
I didn’t know!

561
01:01:12.224 --> 01:01:14.206
I didn’t know she was your fiancée!

562
01:01:14.206 --> 01:01:15.298
Fuck you!

563
01:01:16.256 --> 01:01:18.499
And you’re one to talk?

564
01:01:18.499 --> 01:01:19.959
You’re a cheater yourself.

565
01:01:20.717 --> 01:01:21.884
You’re all the same.

566
01:01:22.787 --> 01:01:24.164
See, King?

567
01:01:24.811 --> 01:01:28.231
Your own siblings don’t even know your fiancée.

568
01:01:28.993 --> 01:01:30.187
Funny.

569
01:01:30.188 --> 01:01:32.104
You really were dating all of us at the same time.

570
01:01:32.111 --> 01:01:33.696
Now you finally picked one.

571
01:01:35.901 --> 01:01:37.069
We’re over!

572
01:01:41.710 --> 01:01:42.905
Bro—

573
01:01:42.905 --> 01:01:45.494
I know I messed up.

574
01:01:45.494 --> 01:01:46.820
Hon, please,

575
01:01:46.821 --> 01:01:48.848
forgive me...

576
01:01:48.848 --> 01:01:51.809
I’ll forget what happened between you and my brother.

577
01:01:53.117 --> 01:01:54.243
We’re even.

578
01:01:55.208 --> 01:01:59.837
Please, don’t leave me, hon. I’ll go crazy without you.

579
01:02:00.803 --> 01:02:03.971
You deserve this, you cheater!

580
01:02:04.426 --> 01:02:09.107
Fuck you and your whole family!

581
01:02:09.114 --> 01:02:11.603
- Let's go. - No. Let go, bro!

582
01:02:11.604 --> 01:02:14.606
I’ve already paid for everything! I spent so much on this!

583
01:02:14.607 --> 01:02:16.608
The engagement party can’t be canceled!

584
01:02:17.484 --> 01:02:19.807
Then have your stupid engagement party alone!

585
01:02:19.807 --> 01:02:22.405
- Fuck you, King! Fuck you! - Just give me a chance!

586
01:02:22.405 --> 01:02:23.823
