590
01:02:42.701 --> 01:02:45.120
- He deserved it. - He’s so dramatic!

591
01:02:51.820 --> 01:02:52.946
Jules?

592
01:02:54.094 --> 01:02:55.104
You know me?

593
01:02:55.107 --> 01:02:56.107
I do.

594
01:02:56.113 --> 01:02:58.313
Aren’t you King’s friend?

595
01:02:58.314 --> 01:03:00.717
I see you on his stories all the time.

596
01:03:00.717 --> 01:03:01.717
Friend?

597
01:03:02.199 --> 01:03:03.346
Me?

598
01:03:03.346 --> 01:03:04.347
Who the heck are you?

599
01:03:04.998 --> 01:03:07.909
- I’m Lani. - Lani?

600
01:03:07.909 --> 01:03:10.600
- King’s girlfriend. - What?

601
01:03:10.601 --> 01:03:13.309
How can you be his girlfriend when I’m King’s girlfriend?

602
01:03:13.309 --> 01:03:14.309
What?

603
01:03:15.018 --> 01:03:16.186
I think we need to talk.

604
01:03:19.093 --> 01:03:20.093
Girls,

605
01:03:20.399 --> 01:03:21.608
thank you for coming.

606
01:03:22.308 --> 01:03:23.308
Isn’t it weird?

607
01:03:23.596 --> 01:03:24.764
We’re all here.

608
01:03:25.721 --> 01:03:26.792
Well...

609
01:03:26.792 --> 01:03:28.709
did you reach out to us...

610
01:03:28.709 --> 01:03:29.835
because you already knew?

611
01:03:32.413 --> 01:03:34.582
We were going to tell you.

612
01:03:35.308 --> 01:03:38.197
Please don’t be mad at us.

613
01:03:40.801 --> 01:03:42.819
I did my research and...

614
01:03:43.298 --> 01:03:46.259
I know he used you guys, too.

615
01:03:52.682 --> 01:03:53.682
Do you want to—

616
01:03:54.517 --> 01:03:55.685
Get back at him?

617
01:03:56.695 --> 01:03:57.695
What?

618
01:03:58.688 --> 01:03:59.688
Hold on...

619
01:04:00.607 --> 01:04:01.607
what’s the plan?

620
01:04:02.191 --> 01:04:04.007
Just nothing violent, okay?

621
01:04:05.505 --> 01:04:07.799
Girls, this is going to be fun.

622
01:04:08.698 --> 01:04:10.117
I need you girls to help me pull this off.

623
01:04:10.802 --> 01:04:13.220
We’re gonna teach King a lesson.

624
01:04:14.191 --> 01:04:18.917
